PARTICLE - step a whole array of TYPE records at native speed.

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD statement (PARTICLE name, n)
  - TYPE ... ENDTYPE records, stepped in place
  - a zero-copy pointer straight into the records' storage

Try it
  TYPE particle : x, y, vx, vy : ENDTYPE
    DIM p(200) AS particle
    PARTICLE "P", 200

Build it on the machine
  grow particle          # -> build/PARTICLE.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as PARTICLE.SED, ready to use.

